SOURCES
The underlying statistics (minimum wages, prices, fares, tariffs, exchange rates) are
published by the governments, statistics offices, central banks and companies named in
the website's source panels and in data/sources.json. Those figures belong to their
publishers and are public; this licence does not restrict anyone from obtaining them from
the original sources. What is protected here is this website's own work: its compilation,
calculations, code, text and design.

